        "original_id": "72b85ac8-51d2-5bc2-9a80-39ea4c3c54cd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pravda, Stiffelio\n- People: Giuseppe Verdi, Francesco Maria Piave, Lajos Magyar\n- Organizations: Communist Party of the Soviet Union, Comintern\n- Places: Soviet Union\n\nFacts:\n- Pravda is a Russian broadsheet newspaper.\n- Pravda was formerly the official newspaper of the Communist Party of the Soviet Union.\n- Pravda was once one of the most influential newspapers in the Soviet Union and had a circulation of 11 million.\n- Stiffelio is an opera in three acts by Giuseppe Verdi with an Italian libretto by Francesco Maria Piave.\n- In 1922, Lajos Magyar went to the Soviet Union as the result of a prisoner exchange.\n- In the Soviet Union, Lajos Magyar worked on the staff of the Comintern and at the newspaper Pravda.",
